# Board miscellaneous refinements

Implement the interaction and presentation refinements in REQ-022-board-misc.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] A two-finger interaction never opens a hex radial, including in edit mode.
- [x] Overview is zoomed out enough for radial controls to remain usable near screen edges.
- [x] Hovering over a number radial option previews that number in the centre token before release.
- [x] Settlement and city icons, including ghost placements, have a sharp black outline.
- [x] The Board background is light blue with subtle wave decoration.
- [x] Relevant unit and UI regression coverage compiles.

